    {
      "id": "text-91",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 455,
      "width": 475.20000000000005,
      "height": 240.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 208944079,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 541962339,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API and default ingress:\n  LAN \u2192 haproxy \u2192 enp1s0 on the masters\n\nService IPs (MetalLB):\n  business network \u2192 infra-0 enp2s0 \u2192 pods on any node\n\nSelected pods (EgressIP):\n  pod on a master \u2192 OVN \u2192 infra-0 enp2s0,\n  source = EgressIP address\n\nAll other pod egress:\n  br-ex \u2192 management \u2192 NAT \u2192 internet",
      "originalText": "API and default ingress:\n  LAN \u2192 haproxy \u2192 enp1s0 on the masters\n\nService IPs (MetalLB):\n  business network \u2192 infra-0 enp2s0 \u2192 pods on any node\n\nSelected pods (EgressIP):\n  pod on a master \u2192 OVN \u2192 infra-0 enp2s0,\n  source = EgressIP address\n\nAll other pod egress:\n  br-ex \u2192 management \u2192 NAT \u2192 internet",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
