      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": ":22623 serves node credentials, so it is\nreachable from the management VMs only.\n\ninfra-0 is a single point of failure for\nthe business network: one speaker, one\negress-assignable node.\n\nIts kubelet (:10250) and node exporter\nstill answer on 192.168.127.20; SSH does not.\n\nOnly the business subnet is reachable:\nenp2s0 has no gateway.",
      "originalText": ":22623 serves node credentials, so it is\nreachable from the management VMs only.\n\ninfra-0 is a single point of failure for\nthe business network: one speaker, one\negress-assignable node.\n\nIts kubelet (:10250) and node exporter\nstill answer on 192.168.127.20; SSH does not.\n\nOnly the business subnet is reachable:\nenp2s0 has no gateway.",
